    "For each unit of a product, must it be processed on exactly one A machine and exactly one B machine (i.e., the unit's A work and B work are each assigned to a single machine, though different units of the same product may be split across machines)?"
  ],
  "rationale": "The response contains a single clarification question asking for a specific policy choice regarding machine assignment per unit."
}

